Cell["\<\
This calculation now completes automatically. The apparent high-energy \
freedom consisted of expressions proved identically zero using external \
identities and momentum conservation. Final checks, including the independent \
Feynman comparison, passed. Evaluate the calculation below to obtain a fresh \
result.\
\>", "Text",ExpressionUUID->"5bf9b874-5178-451d-abc8-ca3270faac6e"],

