Cell["\<\
The independent tests use the constructive expressions above. Full export and \
validation diagnostics remain in eeeeAAExport; a reference formula is never \
substituted. If an export already exists, add \"Overwrite\" -> True \
deliberately to refresh it.\
\>", "Text",ExpressionUUID->"1af0ae66-e77d-56b9-b249-7d2085765df8"]
}, Open  ]]
}, Open  ]],

Cell[CellGroupData[{

Cell["e,E,e,E,e,E", "Chapter",ExpressionUUID->"0b60b2a6-644f-5f88-bad8-eba453faa28e"],

Cell["\<\
This family has diagram-preparation checks, but full automatic completion has \
not yet been established. This calculation runs the complete workflow and \
returns an expression only if every required check passes. An unresolved \
result remains visible as Failure.\
\>", "Text",ExpressionUUID->"4d396abd-34ca-5181-9a59-156cb832b62f"],

